{"task_id": "HumanEval/62", "solution": "def derivative(xs: list):\n    \"\"\" xs represent coefficients of a polynomial: xs[0] + xs[1] * x + xs[2] * x^2 + ....\\\n    Returns the derivative of this polynomial in the same form.\\\n    \"\"\"\n    if not xs:\n        raise ValueError(\"Input coefficients list cannot be empty.\")\n    if len(xs) == 1:\n        return [0]\n\n    derived_coefficients = []\n    for i in range(1, len(xs)):\n        derived_coefficients.append(i * xs[i])\n    return derived_coefficients"}
