{"task_id": "HumanEval/86", "solution": "def anti_shuffle(s: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"\n    Takes a string and returns an ordered version where characters within each word are sorted by ASCII value.\n    The original word order and spacing in the sentence are preserved.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(s, str):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a string.\")\n\n    if not s:\n        return \"\"\n\n    words = s.split(' ')\n    processed_words = []\n    for word in words:\n        if word:\n            processed_words.append(\"\".join(sorted(word)))\n        else:\n            processed_words.append(\"\")\n\n    return \" \".join(processed_words)"}
