{"task_id": "HumanEval/88", "solution": "def sort_array(array):\n    \"\"\"\n    Given an array of non-negative integers, return a copy of the given array after sorting.\n    The sorting order depends on the sum of the first and last elements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not array or len(array) == 1:\n        return list(array)\n\n    first_val = array[0]\n    last_val = array[-1]\n    total_sum = first_val + last_val\n\n    should_sort_ascending = total_sum % 2 != 0\n    \n    array_copy = list(array)\n    \n    if should_sort_ascending:\n        return sorted(array_copy)\n    else:\n        return sorted(array_copy, reverse=True)"}
